{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act24side_level_act24side_06_beg",
  "groupId": "act24side",
  "stageId": "act24side_06",
  "title": "禁飞区",
  "storyCode": "CF-6",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act24side/level_act24side_06_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "0b2a4b5f31508b2e3d07f2afa6061aca820387c83c5bec90aea8d3547026faf0",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喵喵喵喵喵喵喵喵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喵喵喵喵喵喵喵喵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊啊啊喵喵喵......你把俺带偏了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喵哇！要掉下去了喵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你说什么——风太大了——哎哟！俺的面罩！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要掉下去了喵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "俺抓得紧的，你掉不下去的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "火龙！火龙在掉下去喵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，俺的眼睛被面罩挡住了，什么都看不见！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "黑角，黑角喵！火龙它它它——它直冲过去了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "直——直什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要撞上了喵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等等——终于，面罩回正了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊！要撞上了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喵！我的笔记......我的尾巴......都还在，太好了喵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这是哪里？好黑喵......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "黑角......黑角！你还活着喵黑角？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喵，我只看到半截身子挂在上面了，黑角，你不要死掉喵......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "俺没事......可以不要拽俺的腿了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "装备袋里有灯，把它打开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "灯？那是什么？这个吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "对，摁下面的那个开关。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哇，好亮喵！竟然一点都不烫......怎么做到的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还有一件事，俺的角......插在石头里了，可以上来帮俺一下吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......插在石头里了......喵哈哈哈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂！不许笑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喵，我来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "从那边上去，哎哎，别从俺身上爬上来！不要抓那个地方！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "上来了......卡在这里了喵？我敲！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "痛痛痛......俺的屁股。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "火龙呢？你看到它了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "火龙往里面去了喵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "俺们进来的地方......洞口太高了，凭俺俩爬上去得费点功夫，得想点其他法子给夜刀留信号，但是也不能跟丢了火龙......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等等，这里是什么地方？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喵？我还想问你呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "向下的洞穴，火龙下去了......说不定这下面就和村庄那处洞穴相连，看来得下去看一下了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "学者猫，等等俺！你怎么先走了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喵！快点前进！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有太多谜团了喵！泰拉的自然规律应该和我们那里的差不多，却出现了我完全无法理解的情况！火龙的行为太奇怪了喵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "奇怪？那只新出现的艾露猫好像也说了异常之类的词。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "路上再和你解释喵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "火龙钻进了这里面......说不定这里就有导致火龙变奇怪的原因喵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "赌上身为原王立古生物书士队学者的名誉，我一定会把真相弄清楚喵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "黑角喵......你过来看这个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "俺来了——味道臭死了......啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "学者猫，这些难道是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在这里的......全是被火龙撕碎的......生物尸体喵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "甲兽、角兽、羽兽......竟然有这么多种类，它杀死这些动物是当作食物的吗？是吃剩的残渣吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，以火龙的咬合力，连骨头都能碾碎喵，不会有这么多大块的残骸剩下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "生物残骸的外观实际上都非常完整喵，只是被干掉，但没有被啃食的痕迹，不应该是被吃过的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "走，我们往前面看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦，好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喵！怎么会这样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "发现什么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这一块的生物残骸，已经被彻底烧焦了......明明已经被干掉拖进来了，火龙却仍然对着它们吐出火焰，这下根本没法吃了喵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "它是......生气了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这里，这里，还有那里！全都没有喵......所有的生物，它一口都没有吃喵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "火龙它......难道吃不了泰拉的生物吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这会是那个，呃......火龙异常的原因吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不知道......饥饿确实会改变它的行为，但不能确定就是这个造成的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "为什么啊？完全搞不懂喵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "根据观测数据，泰拉的生物应该和我们那里的遵从着相同的规律生长才对，而且我吃你们的食材也完全没有问题喵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "俺觉得，如果不是食物的问题，那问题会不会出在......它身上的源石？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是说火龙感染了矿石病？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——！那是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什么喵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "快，帮俺把这些动物都搬开，土也挖开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好臭喵！你为什么自己不动手？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "谁让你之前骗俺去举钓竿的，这是对你的报复。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喵？嗷......我生气了喵！喵！喵！喵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等等，别闹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......俺明白为什么火龙身上会有源石的痕迹了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你说挖出来的那些坑吗？说明什么喵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这是开采源石矿留下的痕迹，这下面的区域应该是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "源石矿场。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果村庄的人极力隐瞒是因为这片矿场，那俺大概能够理解了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等等！什么叫能够理解了喵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "以东国当前的局势和日益紧缺的资源......一座不为人知的私有源石矿场，光是对外售出粗矿，就能带来超乎想象的收益了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但这种完全私密开采的矿场，如果被外人或者更大的势力知晓，源石矿场就很可能会被出手抢夺，甚至还会带来生命危险。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的意思是，源石本来是地里的矿石，在这里被村子里的人挖出来了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而且你们普遍都会这么干喵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果我没记错喵，源石会让你们染上无法医治的矿石病，还有可能造成毁天灭地的大灾难......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "的确。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那为什么要把它们挖出来哇？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "因为......源石是能源吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "能源？木头可以烧，油脂可以烧，沸腾的水能推动重物转动，不是都可以作为能源喵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "主动接触源石那么危险的东西，怎么想也无法理解喵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "俺想想博士怎么说的来着......泰拉人通过源石技艺利用源石......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "得益于源石引擎技术的进步，源石被广泛作为工业能源使用，而在过去，源石常常被用来施放法术......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "俺不会法术，俺得找个东西给你解释......啊，把灯给俺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你要拿去干嘛？哇，不要拆开喵！要没有光了喵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喏，就是这个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咦？还亮着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看这里，这个东西叫作电池，电池给前面的灯提供了电，灯就会亮起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这和源石有什么关系喵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "电池里面也有源石，还有那个叫什么......施术单元？就是用那个，电池才能把源石转化为噼里啪啦的电流，让灯亮起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "灯是因为源石才亮起来的喵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不止这个，这灯的灯泡、外壳和里面的所有零件，全部都是在工厂里批量生产出来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "批量生产？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就是可以大规模地制作出一模一样的东西，比如这个探照灯，一座很大的工厂一天就能做上千个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "上千个喵！这样太方便了吧......那村里人穿的衣服也是工厂里出来的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是的，工厂靠机器把这些部件做出来，而驱动那些机器的叫作源石引擎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "它们也是靠源石才能运转，在俺们这里的大部分地方都是这样的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以泰拉的科技......甚至文明都建立在源石的基础上喵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大概是这个意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是，我们那里的“猎人”也没有灯，也没有像你们这样的衣服，虽然灯确实很方便喵......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "即使没有用源石那么危险的东西，我们依然可以生活下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在你们这里，源石也是可以被替代的吧喵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在你们那里，“猎人”是很普遍的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "当然喵，因为放任不管的怪物会对村庄居民造成严重的威胁，而我们的生活也依赖怪物产出的素材。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那......“猎人”们每一次狩猎都是安全的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，狩猎......大多数时候都是危机四伏的喵，失败的概率总是大于成功。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "强大的“猎人”是极少数喵，在面对棘手的怪物时，许多的“猎人”都会在狩猎途中牺牲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那其实，源石和你们那里的怪物差不多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喵？什么意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "源石和怪物都是无可避免的威胁，但也提供着生存下去的机遇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喵......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在这里或许见不到，但......实际上天灾在泰拉非常普遍，大部分人都居住在移动城市里，每一座城市都会容纳数以万计的居民。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在天灾来临的时候，整座城市都会开始迁移。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "数以万计的人存在的城市......迁移......喵，好壮观的场景，可要怎样才能让这样的庞然大物移动起来哇？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "源石，只有源石中蕴藏的能量可以驱动移动城市，其他的能源都无法做到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "竟然是这样喵......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "俺们肯定都明白，使用源石也会导致天灾发生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但......当灾难来临的时候，要想活着，哪怕附近只有一根漂浮的树枝，你肯定也会抓住它的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "上面有没有荆棘......至少不是那时该关心的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在没有移动城市，没有广泛利用源石之前，有太多的人因为天灾而死去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "泰拉......太可怕了喵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "荆棘会把手刺得鲜血淋漓，可灾难却不会因为你的痛苦而停止，你只能抓着，一直抓着......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "尽管在努力寻找，但在等到无害的树枝出现之前，你只能这么做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就算历经苦难，也要咬牙活下去......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "黑角喵，虽然还是不能承认你聪明，但你说的确实是对的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "现在想想，我们那里的苦难也并非有所不同喵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "能够对付强大怪物的武器，打造所用的素材同样来自强大的怪物，在这背后是无数的牺牲......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那些在狩猎中无法返回的“猎人”，为开辟新大陆而倒下的调查团成员，为观测危险生物数据而消失不见的书士队前辈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，似乎在所有的地方，人们都是脆弱的，但这片大地总是很残酷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是，就算苦难是必须要承担的，努力生存一定会付出代价，无辜的生命就应该成为牺牲品吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在我们那里没听过这样的事情喵......像源石那样，让那些无辜的人承受了痛苦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他们并不是自愿感染了矿石病，没有救治的话却根本生存不下去喵，这样难道是正确的喵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "当然不正确啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喵，你竟然回答得这么快！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以，要有人站出来承担这个代价，指明前路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们好！有人在那里吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什么声音喵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#5$1",
